title: "Finite-Bar Discrete General Relativity: A Nonsingular Black Hole Model"
abstract: "Spherically symmetric Painlevé-Gullstrand / Misner-Sharp reduction and canonical scalar wave sector of a nonsingular Planck-scale 3D lattice extension of General Relativity with 18- and 27-point isotropic stencils, skew-symmetric summation-by-parts river advection, Cayley symplectic evolution, and Neumann link-decoupled Stefan core accretion."
